        <mxCell id="listc2" value="Hand-built box instead of a 3D print. Outside 46 × 46 × 96 mm, 2 mm sheet walls, inside 42 × 42 × 92 mm. Bigger than v3 to fit the 40 mm speaker, which sits in the back lid.&lt;br&gt;Electronics codes are tronic.lk part numbers. Page 2 draws each module, page 3 each panel to cut, page 4 the inside layout." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="62" width="1090" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
