        <mxCell id="layoutc42" value="46" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;startArrow=block;endArrow=block;startFill=1;endFill=1;startSize=4;endSize=4;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="46" y="520" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="46" y="796" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="layoutc43" value="&lt;b&gt;WHERE EACH PART GOES&lt;/b&gt; (inside mm: x from left wall, y up from floor, z back from front panel)&lt;br&gt;1  OLED: behind the front window, glass against the wall, z 0–4.5&lt;br&gt;3  DevKitC-1: on its long edge against the left wall, components facing the wall, pins facing in, antenna at the front. z 5–70.&lt;br&gt;5  Charger: flat on the floor at the front, USB-C pushed into the front CHARGE slot. x 20–37&lt;br&gt;4  LiPo: standing on its long edge against the right wall, z 30–60 (foam tape)&lt;br&gt;6  Boost: floor, behind the charger, x 15–26, z 28–50&lt;br&gt;10 Accelerometer: floor, flat, x 15–29.5, z 52–72.5 (re-learn faces in Stage 2 calibration)&lt;br&gt;7  Amp: under the top panel at the front, x 14–32, z 8–27&lt;br&gt;9  Mic: under the top panel, port over the hole at z 37 (x 21, centre)&lt;br&gt;8  Speaker: glued inside the lid, magnet reaches z 72. Keep everything else in front of z 70.&lt;br&gt;P7 Screw blocks: back top corners, z 82–92&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;FLASHING&lt;/b&gt;: the DevKit USB now faces the lid inside the box. Take the 2 lid screws out to plug in.&lt;br&gt;Charge only through the front CHARGE port, never both at once." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="130" width="440" height="600" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
